    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Robert Wang",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111490355968417750149/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKX9Lv1_SRN5IJO8zP0JNBXV61ixeJyEUgR7A9ZjavzliIMyw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "I had my patio door replaced last week. Daniel and Danny came on time and they did an excellent job. I am satisfied with the product and the installation.  Thank you Mathieu, Danny and Daniel !",
        "time": 1764609532,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Luigi Vitetta",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101380138583522898032/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKfEppMg5-mqV1LmXeRphfNwswttqstvUp1hH7pNw8gXnZN5Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "Hello, we had a fantastic experience with fenplast. From Alain to the installation team Dany and Daniel,  we were treated extremely well. Everything went smoothly. If you need cheap windows go with Porte et Fenetre Verdun, but if you want better quality windows and doors go with fenplast. Trust me I’ve seen the difference. The fenplast windows are heavier and built better. You work hard for your money so give it to the people that work hard for you. Thanks again",
        "time": 1746455736,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nowfal Mouktani",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113268438198414611419/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXjbVRWhSMGgzyHCxSqZfwNOcrTct64WyR7Gnm5zi3l2fbkiYc=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Told them how another window supplier never answered me after giving them all the info about my project. They laughed and said not to worry. Guess what? Same happened. Gave them all the info, sizes of opening style etc. Even followed up twice with them. Still no quote in sight. Probably the worst customer service from a storefront window store I've had.",
        "time": 1755818633,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Anita Marechal",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112309024994670160326/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKk57-vS7fE16hhkovK2wXfXzhAIq0BRb2TwMpvtnAhxCT5rg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Highly recommend for windows & doors.  Alain came out to give me the estimate and look at my doors to be replaced, extremely professional and fair in estimating.  Dany followed up by doing the exact measurements (my patio door is oversize and not standard).  Everything installed beautifully by Dany and they removed all the old wood and doors, and kept everything clean.  Why shop anywhere else when Fenplast Vaudreuil gives you the best service & fair pricing.",
        "time": 1730479821,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nadeem",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116397840406521394895/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ1S12YiBC_AGUTEcXM0bB2b3YsddrIcoCK93riGMfclJkXbA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I just recently had my new windows and doors installed and I am super impressed with the quality and service I received. The salesman Alain was amazing. The installers CF Lapointe were fantastic! So friendly,professional and punctual. They did an amazing job. Well done Fenplast Vaudreuil!",
        "time": 1710447894,
        "translated": false
      }
